          "text": "Pele na wacetaala aboobo takonzyi kujana kabelele, alete inziba zyobile nanka bana bobile bankwilimba, umwi abe wacipaizyo cakutenta aumwi wacipaizyo cazibi. Lino mupaizi amanye milandu yakwe, asalale.",
